{"articleNo":"63557","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=63557&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[ACE]연구실 레지던트 모집","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.09.03","hit":"5881","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"큰제목\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 15pt\"><strong>『학부교육 선진화 선도대학 지원사업』</strong></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt\" class=\"큰제목\"><strong>연구실 레지던트 프로그램</strong></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt\" class=\"큰제목\"><strong></strong>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: right; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 10pt\" class=\"큰제목\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">1. 참여 자격 및 선발 방법</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">가. 참여 자격 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">재학생 중 산학공동연구, 정부지원과제 및 교내연구개발과제의</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 연구보조원으로 등록된 학부생</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">※제외 대상 : 연구봉사장학금 수혜 예정자, 계약학과 및 외국인 학생, 학기초과자, 직전학기 징계처분을 받은 자</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">나. 추천 주의사항</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">○ 학부(과) 배정된 인원 범위내에서 레지던트 학생 선정</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">※학부(과) 배정내역 [별첨 1호] 참조</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">○ 교수당 최대 2명까지 추천가능</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">○ 4학년 학생 우선 선발</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">○ 현재 등록되지 않은 경우, 신청기간 내에 등록한 후 추천 가능</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">○ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">휴학, 퇴학, 포기 등 신분 변경시, 사업단에 신고</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2. 지원 신청 및 운영 절차 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">가. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">연구실 레지던트 프로그램 참여하고자 하는 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">학생</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">은 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">신청서류를 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">해당 학부(과)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">로 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">9월 11일까지</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 제출</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&lt;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">신청서류</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">&gt; ① 프로그램 참여신청서 [별첨 2호]</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">② 과제참여 증빙자료 </span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">③ 추천서 [별첨 3호]</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">④ 학부모 동의서 [별첨 4호]</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">⑤ 통장 사본</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">⑥ 학생증 사본</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">나. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">각 학부(과)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">는 지원신청 서류를 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">대학교육역량강화사업단</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">에 9</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">월 12일까지</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 제출</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">다. 대학교육역량강화사업단에서는 신청서, 참여자격 및 우선순위 등을 종합 검토하여 레지던트 학생 선발</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">라. 선발 결과 : 2012. 9월 중순 예정(문자발송)</span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">3. 레지던트 학생 의무사항</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">가. 사업단에서 시행하는 오리엔테이션 참석</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">나. 지도교수의 연구과제 매월 10일 이상 참여</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">다. 매월 참여일지[별첨 5호]는 매월 25일까지 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">해당학부(과,전공)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">에 제출</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">(단, 2013년 2월 참여일지는 18일까지 제출)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">라. 사업단에서 시행하는 다른 프로그램 1회 이상 반드시 참여</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">마. 결과보고서[별첨 6호] 제출(다른 프로그램 참여 증빙서류 포함) </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">바.</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 휴학, 퇴학, 포기 등 신분 변경시, 사업단에 보고</span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">4. 지원금</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">가. 지원기간 : 2012년 9월 ~ 2013년 2월 중 참여 연구과제 기간</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">나. 지급시기 : 참여일지 확인 후 익월 10일 지급</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">다. 지급금액 : 150,000원/월 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">라. 참여일지 미제출시, 미지급</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">마. 결과보고서 미제출시, 전액 반납</span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong>5. 일정 안내</strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 2.26pt double; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.7pt solid; WIDTH: 114.07pt; BACKGROUND: #fafabf; HEIGHT: 25.14pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.7pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.41pt solid\" valign=\"center\" colspan=\"2\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">구 분</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 2.26pt double; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.41pt solid; WIDTH: 117.88pt; BACKGROUND: #fafabf; HEIGHT: 25.14pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.7pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.41pt solid\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">학생→해당 학부(과)</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 2.26pt double; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.41pt solid; WIDTH: 117.88pt; BACKGROUND: #fafabf; HEIGHT: 25.14pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.7pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.41pt solid\" valign=\"cente